  "how_measured": "Each DS00144 zip's tail was read by ranged request and the inner CSV name (AL_D151_<sido>_<yyyymmdd>.csv) taken from the central directory; byte sizes come from the bucket listing. The 34 DS00143 objects in the same prefix are D150 DBF siblings with anonymous columns and are deliberately absent here (root ADR-0085 §1).",
